Revision: 7351e6fc603b9b2c2ab4da399b13a9ab0f327398
Reference: main HEAD resolved 2026-09-14
License: public-domain status supplied by the project owner; preserve this
         provenance with the vendored source.

Vendored CPU OCBT layout sources:
- third_party/large_cbt/cbt.h
- third_party/large_cbt/ocbt_generic.h
- third_party/large_cbt/ocbt_{128k,256k,512k,1m}.{h,cpp}

The original repository also contains a DirectX 12 demo and HLSL shaders.
Those are not copied into the engine boundary. Their GPU memory-pool and
indirect-draw algorithm is being reimplemented behind wgpu/WGSL contracts.
